<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>SSoT System Prompts</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we list the full SSoT prompts used in our experiments. For SSoT, we simply used the following prompts as the system prompt in all the experiments <span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
          We replaced <span id="footnote3.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="footnote3.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0”80”94 with <span id="footnote3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">---</span> in the prompts due to formatting issues.</span></span></span>.</p>
<div id="A1.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">helpful</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">AI</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">designed</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">provide</span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">well</span>-<span id="lstnumberx1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">reasoned</span><span id="lstnumberx1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">and</span><span id="lstnumberx1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">detailed</span><span id="lstnumberx1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">responses</span>.<span id="lstnumberx1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">If</span><span