<div id="lstnumberx157" class="ltx_listingline">3.<span id="lstnumberx157.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Output</span><span id="lstnumberx157.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">the</span><span id="lstnumberx157.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">final</span><span id="lstnumberx157.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">integer</span><span id="lstnumberx157.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">in</span><span id="lstnumberx157.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">the</span><span id="lstnumberx157.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">tag</span><span id="lstnumberx157.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>‘&lt;<span id="lstnumberx157.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">random_integer</span>&gt;‘.
</div>
</div>
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">As for the random integer generation experiment in Section <a href="#S5.SS3.SSS2" title="5.3.2 CoT Scaling Analysis ‣ 5.3 Analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ String Seed of Thought: Prompting LLMs for Distribution-Faithful and Diverse Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.3.2</span></a>, we used the system prompt in Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> and the user prompt in Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
