</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.21.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p21.1" class="ltx_p">E (Entropy extraction) <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p21.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p21.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 WHEN TO CHOOSE</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.22.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p22.1" class="ltx_p">--------------------------------</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.23.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p23.1" class="ltx_p">Pick ONE that best matches how the seed is turned into a number (independent of the number of options).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.24.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.25.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p25" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p25.1" class="ltx_p">E=crypto_hash</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.26.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1" class="ltx_p">- Choose when: Mentions SHA-256/sha256/blake2/md5/<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Ccryptographic hash<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D, <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.5" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.6" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cdigest<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.7" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.8" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D, <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.9" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.10" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Chex<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.11" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p26.1.12" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.27.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1" class="ltx_p">- Typical phrases: <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9CSHA-256 hash<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D, <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.5" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.6" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cfirst/last N bytes<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.7" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.8" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D, <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.9" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.10" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Chex → int<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.11" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p27.1.12" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.28.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.28.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
