<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">- Choose when: Treat bytes as base-256 (or base-N) integer (big-endian), e.g., <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p47.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p47.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cn = n*256 + b<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p47.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p47.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D.</span>
