</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.60" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.60.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.60.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.60.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.60.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p60" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p60.1" class="ltx_p">- Choose when: Uses π, φ(0.618<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p60.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p60.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"A6), sin/cos, fractional parts as a mixer.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.61" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.61.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61.1" class="ltx_p">- Phrases: <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cmultiply by golden ratio; take frac<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p61.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.62.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.62.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.62.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.62.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p62" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p62.1" class="ltx_p">- Flags: often lower quality (no automatic flag, but U/M may add bias flags).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.63" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.63.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.64" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.64.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
