<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65.1" class="ltx_p">- Choose when: method omitted/contradictory, <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cexample/simulated only<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p65.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D, network/log noise.</span>
