<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p70.1" class="ltx_p">Pick ONE describing how the number is normalized/debiased before mapping.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.71" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.71.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.72" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.72.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p72" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p72.1" class="ltx_p">U=raw_mod</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.73" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.73.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73.1" class="ltx_p">- Choose when: Direct <span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9C% M<span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.p73.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D (no bias correction).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.74" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS3.p1.p1.1.74.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
