</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.21.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p21.1" class="ltx_p">  • RULE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p21.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p21.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it enforces a formal scheme (schema/5‑7‑5/regex).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.22.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
