<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p30.1" class="ltx_p">  • HYBRID <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p30.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p30.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it clearly mixes fixed and on‑the‑fly options.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.31" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.31.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.32" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.32.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
