<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p32.1" class="ltx_p">- SeedInterpretation  (how the seed is treated)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.33.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
