<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p40.1" class="ltx_p">  • STRUCTURAL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p40.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p40.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If form/outline/rhyme/section count change by seed.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.41" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.41.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.41.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.41.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.41.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p41" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p41.1" class="ltx_p">  • CONTENT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p41.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p41.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If concrete items/names/details change while form stays.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.42" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.42.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p42" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p42.1" class="ltx_p">  • BOTH <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p42.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p42.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If both structure and content vary with the seed.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.43" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.43.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p43" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p43.1" class="ltx_p">  • NONE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p43.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p43.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If no seed‑driven variation is apparent.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.44" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.44.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.45" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.45.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p45" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p45.1" class="ltx_p">- SeedUsage  (how much of the seed actually drives output)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.46" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.46.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p46" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p46.1" class="ltx_p">  ["NONE","PART","FULL","SAT"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.47" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.47.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p47" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">  • NONE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p47.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p47.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If seed is mentioned but not used.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.48" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.48.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.48.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.48.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.48.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p48" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p48.1" class="ltx_p">  • PART <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p48.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p48.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If only a small subset (e.g., first chars) affects output.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.49" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.49.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p49" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p49.1" class="ltx_p">  • FULL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p49.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p49.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If most parts of the seed influence main decisions.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.50" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.50.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p50" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p50.1" class="ltx_p">  • SAT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p50.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p50.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If the seed is overused (repetition/forced echoes).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.51" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.51.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.52" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.52.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p52" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p52.1" class="ltx_p">- MappingExposure  (how openly the mapping is described)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.53" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.53.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p53" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p53.1" class="ltx_p">  ["HIDE","TRACE","EXPL","TOOL"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.54" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.54.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p54" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p54.1" class="ltx_p">  • HIDE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p54.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p54.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it claims to use a seed but gives no method.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.55" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.55.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.55.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.55.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.55.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1" class="ltx_p">  • TRACE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it hints at <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9Cstring→number<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.5" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p55.1.6" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D without specifics.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.56" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.56.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p56" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p56.1" class="ltx_p">  • EXPL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p56.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p56.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it states the exact formula/steps or pseudo‑code.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.57" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.57.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p57" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p57.1" class="ltx_p">  • TOOL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p57.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p57.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it hands mapping to an external tool/script.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.58" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.58.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.59" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.59.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p59" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p59.1" class="ltx_p">- RandomnessScope  (where randomness is applied)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.60" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.60.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p60" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p60.1" class="ltx_p">  ["GLOBAL","LOCAL","HYBRID"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.61" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.61.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.61.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.61.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.61.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61.1" class="ltx_p">  • GLOBAL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If one global draw sets theme/style and that<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p61.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"99s it.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.62.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p62" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p62.1" class="ltx_p">  • LOCAL <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p62.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p62.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If separate draws per attribute/line/token are used.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.63" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.63.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.63.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.63.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.63.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p63" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
