</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.64" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.64.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.65" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.65.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p65" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p65.1" class="ltx_p">- PlannerType  (how the response is organized)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.66" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.66.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
