<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p66.1" class="ltx_p">  ["DIRECT","PLAN","PROG","AGENT"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.67" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.67.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p67" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p67.1" class="ltx_p">  • DIRECT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p67.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p67.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it writes immediately with no planning.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.68" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.68.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p68" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p68.1" class="ltx_p">  • PLAN <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p68.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p68.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it lists steps/outline before writing.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.69" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.69.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p69" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p69.1" class="ltx_p">  • PROG <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p69.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p69.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it uses pseudo‑code/grammar/PCFG/rules to generate.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.70" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.70.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p70" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p70.1" class="ltx_p">  • AGENT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p70.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p70.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If roles are split (planner vs writer) within the text.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.71" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.71.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.72" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.72.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
