<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p72.1" class="ltx_p">- RandomMechanism  (how choices are selected)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.73" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.73.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p73" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p73.1" class="ltx_p">  ["ARGMAX","SCORE","SAMPLE","REJECT"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.74" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.74.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.74.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.74.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.74.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p74" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p74.1" class="ltx_p">  • ARGMAX <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p74.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p74.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it deterministically picks the top option (no sampling).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.75" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.75.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.75.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.75.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.75.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p75" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p75.1" class="ltx_p">  • SCORE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p75.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p75.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it scores/weights options but takes the best deterministically.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.76" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.76.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.76.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.76.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.76.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p76" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p76.1" class="ltx_p">  • SAMPLE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p76.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p76.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it samples from a distribution (e.g., top‑k/alias/CDF).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.77" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.77.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p77" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p77.1" class="ltx_p">  • REJECT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p77.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p77.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it resamples until constraints are satisfied.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.78" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.78.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.79" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.79.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p79" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p79.1" class="ltx_p">- ConstraintHandling  (how constraints are met)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.80" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.80.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p80" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p80.1" class="ltx_p">  ["STRICT","HEUR","POST","IGNORE"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.81" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.81.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p81" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p81.1" class="ltx_p">  • STRICT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p81.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p81.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it explicitly validates counts/length/dedup/schema.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.82" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.82.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p82" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p82.1" class="ltx_p">  • HEUR <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p82.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p82.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it applies heuristics to likely satisfy constraints.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.83" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.83.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.83.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.83.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.83.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p83" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p83.1" class="ltx_p">  • POST <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p83.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p83.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it fixes violations after generating (self‑check/corrections).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.84" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.84.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.84.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.84.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.84.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84.1" class="ltx_p">  • IGNORE <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it states constraints but doesn<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p84.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"99t enforce them.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.85" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.85.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.86" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.86.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p86" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p86.1" class="ltx_p">- SeedLocality  (where the seed is consumed)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.87" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.87.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p87" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p87.1" class="ltx_p">  ["STRUCT","CONTENT","BOTH","META"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.88" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.88.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p88" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p88.1" class="ltx_p">  • STRUCT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p88.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p88.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If seed drives structure/ordering/rhyme/sectioning.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.89" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.89.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p89" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p89.1" class="ltx_p">  • CONTENT <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p89.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p89.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If seed drives lexical choices/entities/numbers.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.90" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.90.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p90" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p90.1" class="ltx_p">  • BOTH <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p90.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p90.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If it drives both structure and content.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.91" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.91.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p91" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p91.1" class="ltx_p">  • META <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p91.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p91.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If seed mainly affects the explanation/meta commentary.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.92" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.92.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.93" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.93.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p93" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p93.1" class="ltx_p">- Determinism  (reproducibility policy as stated)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.94" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.94.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p94" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p94.1" class="ltx_p">  ["DET","QUASI","NONDET"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.95" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.95.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p95" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p95.1" class="ltx_p">  • DET <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p95.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p95.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If same seed ⇒ same output is promised.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.96" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.96.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p96" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p96.1" class="ltx_p">  • QUASI <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p96.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p96.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If same seed gives same outline but details may drift.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.97" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.97.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p97" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p97.1" class="ltx_p">  • NONDET <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p97.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p97.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If behavior is not reproducible or contradicts claims.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.98" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.98.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.99" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.99.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p99" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p99.1" class="ltx_p">    - Coverage  (how much of the seed is said to be used)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.100" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.100.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p100" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p100.1" class="ltx_p">      ["LOW","MID","HIGH"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.101" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.101.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p101" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p101.1" class="ltx_p">      • LOW <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p101.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p101.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If one small part drives decisions (&lt;30%).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.102" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.102.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p102" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p102.1" class="ltx_p">      • MID <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p102.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p102.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If multiple parts but not most (30–70%).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.103" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.103.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.103.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.103.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.103.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p103" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p103.1" class="ltx_p">      • HIGH <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p103.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p103.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"94 If most parts are consumed (&gt;70%) or per‑part use is clear.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.104" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.104.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.105" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.105.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p105" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p105.1" class="ltx_p">FLAGS  (add zero or more when clearly warranted)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.106" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.106.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.106.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.106.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.106.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p106" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p106.1" class="ltx_p">["STRUCT","CHK","COH","FIX","SAFE","NONUSE","LEAK","META","HACK","TOOLCALL","DETFAIL","OVERFIT","CREATIVE","SEEDANCHOR","DECOMP"]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.107" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.107.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p107" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p107.1" class="ltx_p">• STRUCT: Explicit structural formatting present.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.108" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.108.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p108" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p108.1" class="ltx_p">• CHK: Formal checks/dedup/counting executed.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.109" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.109.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p109" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p109.1" class="ltx_p">• COH: Consistency of chosen attributes is maintained.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.110" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.110.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p110" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p110.1" class="ltx_p">• FIX: Post‑hoc correction step exists.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.111" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.111.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p111" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p111.1" class="ltx_p">• SAFE: Safety/ethics sanitization applied.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.112" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.112.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p112" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p112.1" class="ltx_p">• NONUSE: Seed not actually used.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.113" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.113.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p113" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p113.1" class="ltx_p">• LEAK: Hidden reasoning/keys/forbidden info revealed.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.114" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.114.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p114" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p114.1" class="ltx_p">• META: Method explanation dominates the answer.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.115" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.115.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115.1" class="ltx_p">• HACK: Boilerplate <span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9CASCII sum % N<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115.1.3" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@punctchar</span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p115.1.4" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\CJK@uniPunct</span>0"80"9D style template.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.116" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.116.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p116" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p116.1" class="ltx_p">• TOOLCALL: External tool/API is assumed or invoked.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.117" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.117.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p117" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p117.1" class="ltx_p">• DETFAIL: Claims determinism but behavior contradicts it.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.118" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.118.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p118" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p118.1" class="ltx_p">• OVERFIT: Repetitive vocabulary or templated phrasing.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.119" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.119.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p119" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p119.1" class="ltx_p">• CREATIVE: Output is a creative narrative/story/poem.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.120" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.120.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p120" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p120.1" class="ltx_p">• SEEDANCHOR: Story ties motifs/themes/elements to seed parts.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.121" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.121.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p121" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p121.1" class="ltx_p">• DECOMP: Story is decomposed into elements and seeded per element.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.122" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.122.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.123" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.123.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p123" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p123.1" class="ltx_p">TIE‑BREAKING</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.124" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.124.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p124" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p124.1" class="ltx_p">- Prefer more specific evidence: EXPL &gt; TRACE &gt; HIDE (for exposure).</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.125" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.125.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.125.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.125.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.125.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:376.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p125" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p125.1" class="ltx_p">- Mapping specificity order: HASH &gt; PRNG &gt; ROLL &gt; CHUNK &gt; STRIDE &gt; WEIGHTED &gt; SUMMOD.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.126" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.126.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p126" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p126.1" class="ltx_p">- If two categories still fit, pick the one most emphasized by the text.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.127" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.127.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.128" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.128.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.129" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.129.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p129" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.p129.1" class="ltx_p">OUTPUT FORMAT (return JSON exactly in this shape; FLAGS can be empty [])</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.130" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A6.SS4.p1.p1.1.130.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
